        <div id="post-718" class="post-718 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized">

          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2008/07/video-conferencing-code-of-conduct/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: Video Conferencing Code of Conduct">Video Conferencing Code of Conduct</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Jul</span>
            <span class="day">7</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/category/uncategorized/" title="View all posts in Uncategorized" rel="category tag">Uncategorized</a> | <a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/2008/07/video-conferencing-code-of-conduct/#respond" class="comments"  title="Comment on Video Conferencing Code of Conduct"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="718 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2008/07/07/video-conferencing-code-of-conduct.aspx">No Comments</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

          <div class="post-content clearfix">
